msgctxt "SettingsAppearance"
msgid "Background image darkness"
msgstr "背景画像の暗さ"

#: ui
msgctxt "SettingsAppearance"
msgid "3D background camera movement"
msgstr "3D背景のカメラ移動"

#: ui
msgctxt "SettingsAppearance"
msgid "When disabled, the camera stops moving forward and the background stops updating after rendering, completely eliminating background overhead"
msgstr "無効にすると、描画完了後にカメラの前進と背景の更新が停止し、背景の処理負荷を完全になくします"

#: ui
msgctxt "SettingsAppearance"
msgid "Background parallax"
msgstr "背景のパララックス"

#: ui
msgctxt "SettingsAppearance"
msgid "When disabled, the background no longer moves with the mouse"
msgstr "無効にすると、背景がマウスに合わせて動かなくなります"

#: ui
msgctxt "SettingsAudio"
msgid "Background music"
msgstr "BGM"

